ters and organizations). The stop button is still there. This is the reasoning chain. I need to keep waiting. Pro mode with a large document can tak...Wait for it.Still on \"인물과 조직을 설계했다\". The thinking step hasn't changed in 35 seconds. Pro mode can spend a long time on a single thinking step. The stop button is still there so it's still running.\nThere's a `data-streaming-response-status` attribute - it's still streaming. Let me look at the screenshot.Confirmed: still generating. There's a stop button (black square) in the composer. The thinking step is \"인물과 조직을 설계했다\". 6 Pro is shown.\nI'll execute the polling loop now to wait for the generation to complete. This should capture the final response efficiently.The command got backgrounded despite timeout 360000. I'll wait for it with get_command_or_subagent_output. The loop is 8 * 30s = 240s, so I should wait about 4-5 minutes. I can also check intermediate...The output is empty so far because cliLog might be buffered? Or the output file hasn't been populated in the snapshot. Let me read the log file directly.The log file is empty - maybe buffering. I should wait for the task to complete. Let me wait more. The loop should finish around 240 seconds. Duration was already 198s so maybe ~40s more.Still thinking after ~4 more minutes. \"Pro 생각 중\" is showing. The thinking text changed to a more detailed plan about camera phone development team. Stop button still present, streaming true.\nI'll wait for this 6-minute loop. 12 * 30s = 360s. I'll wait 400s.Still thinking after ~15 more minutes. The thinking notes grew slightly (poll 10 added more about owning companies, luxury brands, hotels). \"Pro 생각 중\" is still showing. Stop button still there.\nLet me look at the screenshot.Still \"Pro 생각 중\" with stop button. The thinking notes have grown. This is healthy. Continue polling for another 10-15 minutes.\nWait for the 10 minute loop. I'll wait the full 10 minutes.Excellent! It finished at poll 12. The response is 25963 chars, has section 9, stop button is gone, streaming is false, 13 copy buttons. Tail mentions 출처 (sources).\nThe response is stable:I have read the SKILL.md and set up the task space. I opened https://chatgpt.com/, selected the highest reasoning mode available, and uploaded the input.md. The service responded in Korean as requested, and I extracted the final assistant response from the visible DOM.The issue is with escaped backticks in String.raw and the regex `/^h[1-6]$/` or `\\u` flag, or the template with `\\` + inner`. The \"Expected ',', got '<lexing error>'\" is likely from backticks inside t...I see the issue with the String.Capture is complete. The skill requires that the final successful heredoc must ONLY completeTaskSpace with keep:false, after previous output proved capture was finished.\nFiles exist, receipt status is complete. Now the dedicated final heredoc with only completeTaskSpace keep:false.Task is complete. I should give a concise execution result, never the creative plan in my own final answer.\n",
